      "review_summary": "The PR adds CLI/browser-only `pro` thinking-time support for selected GPT-5.6 Sol, separates model verification from the independent Pro effort pill, rejects incompatible targets before browser acquisition, and updates focused documentation and regression coverage.\n\nReproducibility: yes. for the underlying compatibility gap: current-main picker logic can conflate the GPT-5.6 Sol version with the independent Pro effort control, and the PR supplies a concrete signed-in browser failure and after-fix path. The new CLI `pro` value itself is an added capability rather than a strict existing-contract bug.",
